11:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed italic","children":["“","Had a perforated eardrum since childhood with constant water discharge. Dr. Dhirendra Singh Kushwah performed a microscopic tympanoplasty. The ear is 100% dry and my hearing test shows normal hearing now! Blessed to have found him.","”"]}]
