13:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed italic","children":["“","I was terrified of septoplasty because of old horror stories about nasal packing removal. Dr. Kushwah performed his painless packless technique. I had zero packing, could breathe immediately after waking up, and felt zero pain!","”"]}]
