15:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed italic","children":["“","My 6-year-old son had severe mouth breathing and sleep apnea due to enlarged adenoids and tonsils. Dr. Kushwah used coblation technology. He recovered smoothly within 4 days and now sleeps peacefully throughout the night.","”"]}]
